# Trickeoglyph — Perkeo ante 1 + Canio ante 8
#
# WHERE IT LIVES
#   JAML:   JamlFilters/Trickeoglyph.jaml  (this file)
#           MotelyNativeFilter.Trickeoglyph
#
#
# Deep ante-1 slot 5 Negative Perkeo = hieroglyph-deep-perkeo.jaml (different filter)

id: trickeoglyph
name: Trickeoglyph
author: pifreak
description: >
  Soul Perkeo in ante 1 (packs 0-3) and Soul Canio in ante 8 (packs 0-5).
  Mirror of native TrickeoglyphFilterDesc.
deck: Red
stake: White

must:
  - legendaryJoker: Perkeo
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      boosterPacks: [0, 1, 2, 3]

  - legendaryJoker: Canio
    antes: [8]
    sources:
      boosterPacks: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
